Z||000004||artherd||12-08-2001||03:50 AM||||Hey Tom, wow you're fast! 'Spring 2002' is what I'm offically shooting for   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> <P>Just in time for Sears Point to open back up &lt;evil grin!&gt; Can't wait to feel the nice smooth new roadcourse pavement!<P>(finances permitting of course, if it weren't for that darn green stuff I'd be done by now!)<P>Just got the corvette fuel pump (96 corvette pump is a *drop-in* replacement for our cars!) installed and the tank cleaned today.  Hey, it's progress.<P>Best!<BR>Ben.<P>  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by California Kid:<BR><B>Looking Good Ben!!! What's your time table for completion??</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>------------------<BR>       <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/sig1.jpeg">     <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top, Metalic Red                     "Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>88 Formula, Northstar, Silver                                        -Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"<p>[This message has been edited by artherd (edited 12-08-2001).]||||reg||3
