Z||000006||Formula88||12-08-2001||04:28 PM||||<B><I>AWESOME!!!</B></I><BR>I know you're all the way over there on the "left" coast, but I hope you can bring that beast to some shows next year.  I wanna see (and hear!) that sucker do what it was meant to do!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>I'll still have my 2.8 - an engine swap is still a ways off for me.  I haven't even decided on what motor I want, yet.  It'll probably end up being what I find in good shape at a good price when I'm ready to go.<BR>3.4DOHC, 3800SC, N*, or even a SBC - so, yeah, I'm still very early in the planning stages.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  I do like the idea of a DOHC motor, though.  Fits the car's personality better.||||reg||1
